  "factor_name": "VIX 75th-percentile stress-conditioned 20-day reversal",
  "version": "2034-10-26",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "shift1((-pct_change(close,20)) * I(VIX > rolling_quantile(VIX,120,0.75)) )",
    "description": "Contrarian cross-asset 20-day return signal, activated only when observation-only VIX is above its trailing 120-session 75th percentile. Signal is lagged one completed session and ranked cross-sectionally; zero-valued inactive observations are retained for portfolio defensive use."
